    "body": "Digging in it appears the answer here is that because of the microtask deferral, the enqueued microtask actually does not run until the first read is initiated, so I'm suspecting that the enqueue is actually fulfulling the read causing the desiredSize not to change, but it's counter-intuitive at best.\n\nthis, btw, came up from a user who was reporting it as an odd edge case.",
